  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hantering av avfallsbrunnar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Management of radon wells</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better management of waste disposal sites</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad avfallshantering</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r relaterat till avveckling av lager av brunnstyp vid Radonanl&#xe4;ggningar i Ukraina d&#xe4;r nedlagda slutna radioaktiva k&#xe4;llor har lagrats. Det inkluderar f&#xf6;rstudier och projektdokumentation f&#xf6;r avveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is related to decommissioning of well-type storages at Radon facilities in Ukraine where disused sealed radioactive sources have been stored. It includes feasibility studies and design docummentation for decommissioneing.</narrative>
  </description>
